{% doc %}
  Renders a decorative social-media icon. The parent link provides its accessible name.

  @param {string} name - Supported icon name: instagram, threads, facebook, x, pinterest, youtube, tiktok, snapchat, tumblr, linkedin, or vimeo.
{% enddoc %}

